    "body": "@js-choi raises a good point, it would be nice to somehow interact with the list of search results the browser finds. It would be useful for certain usecases to also provide a list of matches that the browser should use as the search results. I would imagine most people disabling find are just looking to implement that UI themselves, so providing hooks to keep the default UI, but modify the results could be useful.",
