    "created_at": "2018-01-30T08:10:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-30T08:10:29Z",
    "body": "An alternative API could be based on streams, where you push scroll offsets and the browser consumes them and updates its counters based on that and is able to scroll with that information as well. That would be a little closer to how browsers do it internally I think and would allow for the same kind of UI throughout.",
