    "body": "This would be a huge accessibility mistake, as users don't expect their page to be updated as they use the \"find in page\" feature of their browser. If you override the user agent's default [tabindex](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#the-tabindex-attribute) attribute for a particular Element along with the existing search, you can already get what you want. \n\nThis will break many things such keyboard navigation, selection, copy paste and pretty much every API there is out there.",
